+### 2340 — The Rule-1 Production Control Ran the Unmutated Gate
+- FINDING: Review `RUN-260825-bd12e8` of `TASK-260825-lsojra` (implementation of spec revision 9). §12.3.1 rule 1 requires every shape mutant to be shown admitting the plain valid frame **at the production `runtime-launch` entry**, one process per mutant. The candidate spawns those 18 processes. None of them runs its mutant: `TestMain` (`tools/agents-infra/internal/infra/pi_shared_integration_test.go:56`) installs a `sharedAuthorizationDecode` wrapper that decodes the delivered bytes with the **specified** decoder, then evaluates `authMutantVerdict` against a **constant, harness-built** plain frame. The mutant is never the decoder; the bytes never meet it.
